@startuml
title Find contacts by phone
start
:FindCommandParser tokenizes selectors;
if (Exactly one non-empty /phone selector,\nno other selector, repetition or preamble?) then (yes)
  :Create PhoneEqualsPredicate;
  :Normalize Unicode whitespace and\nremove all spaces from query;
  :Create FindCommand(predicate);
else (no)
  :Throw ParseException;
  stop
endif
:FindCommand sets the model filter to\nactive AND exact phone match after\nremoving whitespace from stored number;
:Read size of filtered person list;
if (No matches?) then (yes)
  :Return no-results CommandResult;
else (no)
  :Return match-count CommandResult;
endif
:LogicManager saves unchanged contact data;
stop
@enduml
